# Mine Raider's intervening "if" (CR 603.4, 700.12a): Bot1 controls Triton Shorethief, a Rogue and so another outlaw, as the Raider enters, so the trigger
# goes on the stack and resolves into one Treasure token (CR 111.10a). Trample (CR 702.19b): the Raider (3 power) attacks into Bot2's Memnite (1/1)
# blocker, assigns lethal 1 to it and tramples over for 2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Triton Shorethief
Mine Raider
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Triton Shorethief.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mine Raider.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Treasure Token.Tapped = false
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Mine Raider > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Memnite > Mine Raider)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Treasure Token.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 7
Bot1.Battlefield.Mine Raider.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Mine Raider.Toughness = 2
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite = (absent)
